    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Sky Symphony, the ultimate side-scrolling flying adventure! Take flight and control your aircraft by holding down the mouse to ascend and releasing it to descend. The gameplay is simple to learn, but challenging to master.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs you progress through the game, the challenges will become more and more difficult. The obstacles will increase in number and complexity, and the time between obstacles will become shorter. You'll need to hone your skills and develop lightning-fast reflexes to survive for as long as possible.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut don't worry - there are power-ups and other bonuses scattered throughout the game that can help you stay in the air longer and earn more points. Collect them as you fly and use them strategically to improve your chances of survival.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith its addictive gameplay, beautiful graphics, and challenging difficulty, Sky Symphony is a game that you won't be able to put down. So buckle up and get ready to take flight - it's time to show off your flying skills and conquer the skies!",
